id: TEST-012
ilities: [reliability-maturity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: advisory
title: Test timeout disabled
category: reliability
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .js .ts .mjs
  filenames: jest.config.js jest.config.ts vitest.config.ts vitest.config.js .mocharc.yml .mocharc.json
  exclude_paths: .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: Timeout
patterns:
  - regex: timeout:\s*0|testTimeout:\s*0|jest\.setTimeout\(0\)
    message: "Test timeout disabled — hanging tests block CI forever"
fix: Set a reasonable timeout (e.g., 5000ms for unit tests, 30000ms for integration tests). Never disable timeouts.
